<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Vision Monthly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Vision rents by the month in Hanoi for a verified band of 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND, with the exact figure for your machine and dates confirmed at the counter. This guide shows what that monthly rate buys, how it compares with the 200,000 VND daily and 1,000,000 VND weekly structures, and how to budget a full month of city riding around a number the desk settles in a minute. Every figure here comes from the published price list, and where the site publishes a range, the guide says so plainly and points you to the counter for the exact number.</p>
<p>We walk through the verified figures, the arithmetic that makes the month the cheapest structure for long stays, the riders the Vision suits best, and the deposit, gear and support questions a monthly agreement adds. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
